{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"636012145204527127","content":"Small warning: this message might make people worried about Covid more anxious, but I want to be honest about what's going on so here it is :/\n\nI really wanted to be online today but I've been kind of shot with a big dose of reality and I think I'm going to need some time offline. My health has been kind of off lately and this morning I finally had a virtual appointment with my doctor. I thought worse case scenario I'd maybe have to come in and get some blood work done or something but instead she referred me to get tested for Covid-19, which I just got back from doing. My symptoms are in no way serious, so even if this is Covid I consider myself very lucky. I don't even have a fever or cough, which is why I was so caught off guard by being asked to get tested. The test results should come back within 24-48 hours so I suppose I'll know for sure soon. I'm going to be really surprised if it's covid since I've been doing everything you're supposed to do in a pandemic (stay home, wear a mask), but I guess if any of you haven't been doing that then... Pls do it. \nI might still be checking in to read the story from time to time but I don't think I'll be up for any rp until I have a better handle on what's going on. My room is already set up for me to basically live in it in case college gets cancelled so self isolating shouldn't be too bad. I even have my own coffee machine :)\nI know my character has been a bit important right now with stuff like Zone of Truth and I wish she could be there for the story, but I think you guys know my character pretty well by now so just do me a favor and imagine what she'd do. Game wise she can just spend all her time in the library reading 😌","created_at":"2020-07-30T00:18:17.289000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738188684591104072","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
